    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the social services law and the public health law, in relation\nto prohibiting Medicaid from requiring prior authorization for HIV medication",
    "basePrintNo": "S5534",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S5534-2025",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
